# The lab of 01-build-a-lab.sh (and of lab.mrn), asserted:  mrn-verify lab.mrv
#
# One assertion per line, comments and blank lines ignored. Everything here is about the MODEL —
# what Marionnet knows by construction — so it holds whether or not anything is running, and
# needs no guest. The assertions that need a running guest (journals, reports) are in
# 06-assert-a-lab.sh, which starts a machine first.

state m1 is off
state m2 is off
state s1 is off

field m1 port_no is 2
field s1 port_no is 8

cable c1 m1:eth0 s1:port1
cable c2 m2:eth0 s1:port2
